# ATC engine

SDK-free modules under `src/atc/` (+ `flows/`). Plugin-only: `atc_session` (PTT coordinator).

## Pipeline

Transcript → `intent_parser` (rules) → if confidence < 0.7 → `backends::lm()` → `atc_state_machine` → template response → TTS via `backends::tts()`.

## Profiles

- `data/atc_profiles/de/` — NfL DACH-VFR; BZF-strict / conformance active when `atc_profile()=="DE"`
- `data/atc_profiles/en/` — ICAO VFR (Doc 4444 / Annex 10 / SERA); strict hooks inert
- Templates / rules / hints / ui_strings / conformance are data-driven — prefer editing JSON over hardcoding

## Conformance (DE)

`initial_call_conformance` loads `conformance.json`: `required` vs `recommended`. Strict mode uses union. H2: phraseology hint must match `recommended` (enforced in tests). "ERBITTE ROLLEN" belongs to `REQUEST_TAXI`, not the initial-call hint.

## State sketch

`IDLE` → ground/tower/pattern/landing/en-route/UNICOM. Controlled = GROUND/TOWER flow; uncontrolled = `UNICOM_ACTIVE` (announce only). See `CLAUDE.md` for the full transition graph.
